  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To work out ${(-4)}^{3},$ we multiply $-4$ by itself and then multiply the result by $-4$ again:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-4)^{3} & =\\overset{16}{\\overset{⏞}{(-4)\\cdot (-4)}}\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =16\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =-64\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
